# 0.1.19 相对 0.1.18 的净变化；一条一行，格式「分类|语言|内容」
updated|zh|目录重构：程序本体集中 /opt/github-net/，特权状态集中 /var/opt/github-net/，配置维持 ~/.config/github-net/；升级自动清理旧路径，配置零丢失
updated|en|Directory restructure: program files consolidated under /opt/github-net, privileged state under /var/opt/github-net, user config unchanged; the upgrade cleans legacy paths automatically
updated|zh|特权服务 socket 访问模型升级：0660＋访问组制（内核把关），消除「本机任意进程可连」的历史残余风险；升级后需重新登录一次使组资格生效
updated|en|Privileged socket model upgraded to 0660 with an access group enforced by the kernel, removing the old any-local-process residual risk; log out and back in once after upgrading
fixed|zh|修复开机自启动指向旧安装路径、开机拉不起应用的问题
fixed|en|Fixed autostart pointing at the legacy install path so the app failed to launch at boot
fixed|zh|修复应用菜单图标丢失与菜单启动失败的问题：桌面项 Exec/Icon 改绝对路径
fixed|en|Fixed the missing menu icon and failed launches: desktop entry now uses absolute Exec/Icon paths
fixed|zh|修复写 Hosts 全部失败的沙箱误伤：白名单放行目录而非单个文件，临时文件与替换流程恢复正常
fixed|en|Fixed all Hosts writes failing under the service sandbox: the allowlist now covers the /etc directory so temp-file-and-rename works again
fixed|zh|「写入可用IP」更名「补充可用IP」，说明写明 10 分钟复验与映射更新语义
fixed|en|"Apply usable IPs" renamed to "Supplement usable IPs" with the 10-minute re-verification and mapping-update semantics spelled out
updated|zh|/etc/hosts 管理区段标记匹配泛化：产品改名后旧区段照常识别与还原
updated|en|The managed /etc/hosts section now matches markers regardless of the product id, keeping restores working across renames
updated|zh|免密配置脚本改两段式：普通用户态取身份，sudo 只做特权动作，不再依赖受限环境里的 Go
updated|en|The passwordless setup script now runs identity resolution as the invoking user and passes values explicitly, no longer depending on Go inside the restricted sudo environment
